            "summary": "Interlink Electronics Inc. (NASDAQ:LINK) shares are trading higher on Wednesday after the company said that it will issue a 50% common stock dividend on October 28, 2025. The dividend will be payable to shareholders of record as of the close of business on October 14, 2025. The stock dividend will apply uniformly to all shareholders, preserving each investor\u2019s percentage ownership in the company, except in cases where the dividend would result in fractional shares. Instead of issuing fractional",
